WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:02.322
Write the report for a person who was asleep while the

00:00:02.357 --> 00:00:03.030
work happened.

00:00:03.471 --> 00:00:06.792
Put the outcome and artifact links first, followed by what

00:00:06.838 --> 00:00:09.996
is built, verified, unverified, or blocked.

00:00:10.437 --> 00:00:13.839
Include checks and evidence, the actual route and usage if

00:00:13.897 --> 00:00:18.646
exposed, decisions taken, unresolved effects, rollback,

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:19.772
and the next action.

00:00:20.376 --> 00:00:22.976
Make the first few things to inspect easy to find.

00:00:23.418 --> 00:00:26.703
If the job ran out of time, report partial completion

00:00:26.819 --> 00:00:30.012
accurately rather than stretching the definition of done.
